message: "If you use PRATIK Kernel Core, please cite it as below."
title: "PRATIK Kernel Core — MVP (balanced-ternary, event-driven developmental kernel)"
abstract: >-
  A resource-bounded, balanced-ternary, event-driven reference kernel implementing the
  PRATIK/PEDLER core: autogenous dimensional spawning, resource-modulated persistence and
  crystallization, and a verification harness proving the recollection theorem and the
  accommodation/crystallization axioms. CPU (C++20) and CUDA backends, plus a dependency-free
  interactive 3D visualizer.
type: software
